    "An illustration of the direction, not a measurement: as agents take more routine, more of the week is yours": "",
    "01 / HOW IT WORKS": "",
    "From an empty Mac": "",
    "to agents at work": "",
    "Four steps, each useful on its own. Start with the one you need and add the rest when the work calls for it.": "",
